files, and a token that may only read them
  acts   enter show · o open · z bigger
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first file, end last file]
  full   [enter show this file, o open it outside the terminal, z give the preview the whole pane]
files, and a token that may add and remove them
  acts   enter show · o open · u attach · d delete · z bigger
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first file, end last file]
  full   [enter show this file, o open it outside the terminal, z give the preview the whole pane]
  full   [u attach a file, d delete this file]
nothing attached, and nothing this token may attach
  acts   
  full   []
nothing attached, and a token that may attach one
  acts   u attach
  full   [u attach a file]
typing a path
  acts   ctrl+s attach it · esc leave it unattached
  full   [ctrl+s attach it, esc leave it unattached]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
a deletion waiting for an answer
  acts   y delete it · esc keep it
  full   [y delete it, esc keep it]
